{"unit_id":"xinchun2018__dsh-origin-thesis#card-zh","repo":"xinchun2018/dsh-origin-thesis","commit":"d4b2ce03dbaf14f2201086f4305e2247f52ffb40","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-origin-thesis 是面向 OriginLab Origin 科学绘图的 DSH 工具包，可从 MCP 工具调用论文图格式化、拼版和导出流程。它提供 thesis、composite 与 manuscript 样式档，可按图层数量整理整份项目，也可只处理指定图或手工拼好的多面板图；格式包括字体、轴、线条、面板标签和图像尺寸。工具还支持查看与调整样式、批量处理项目、单独导出和只读核验。适合需要统一论文或期刊插图的 Origin 用户；要求 Windows、本机 Origin/OriginPro 和配置了 originpro 的 Python 环境。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:26-40","thesis_mcp_server.py:624-660","thesis_mcp_server.py:965-985","thesis_mcp_server.py:1132-1150"]}
{"unit_id":"xinchun2018__dsh-origin-thesis#card-en","repo":"xinchun2018/dsh-origin-thesis","commit":"d4b2ce03dbaf14f2201086f4305e2247f52ffb40","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-origin-thesis formats OriginLab figures from DSH. It applies thesis, composite, or manuscript styles to projects, graphs, and multi-panel figures, then exports images or verifies formatting. Users can inspect styles and batch projects. Requires Windows, Origin, and Python with originpro.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:26-40","thesis_mcp_server.py:624-660","thesis_mcp_server.py:965-985","thesis_mcp_server.py:1132-1150"]}
